      <title>GitHub两千星高中生用WorkBuddy把撞墙式学习做成大一新生工作台</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/ai001/post/20260901/GitHub%E4%B8%A4%E5%8D%83%E6%98%9F%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E7%94%9F%E7%94%A8WorkBuddy%E6%8A%8A%E6%92%9E%E5%A2%99%E5%BC%8F%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0%E5%81%9A%E6%88%90%E5%A4%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B0%E7%94%9F%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C%E5%8F%B0/</link>
